# HNX (owa.hnx.vn / hnx.vn) TLS chain-completion bundle
# Task: BCTC-HNX-SSL-HARDEN (2026-07-02)
#
# HNX's server (nginx) omits the "GlobalSign RSA OV SSL CA 2018" intermediate
# from its served TLS chain (openssl verify code 21: unable to verify the
# first certificate). This bundle supplies the missing intermediate + its
# GlobalSign root so `curl --cacert` can verify the HNX leaf without -k.
#
# Provenance: intermediate fetched directly from the CA Issuers URL embedded
# in the AIA extension of the live HNX leaf cert itself
# (http://secure.globalsign.com/cacert/gsrsaovsslca2018.crt); root fetched
# from GlobalSign's official root repository
# (http://secure.globalsign.com/cacert/root-r3.crt) and cross-verified
# against GlobalSign's own root validation endpoint
# (https://valid.r3.roots.globalsign.com/) plus its independently published
# SHA-256 fingerprint. See docs/vps-sources/hnx-tls-chain-2026-07-02.txt for
# the leaf recon.
#
# 1) Intermediate: CN=GlobalSign RSA OV SSL CA 2018, O=GlobalSign nv-sa, C=BE
#    SHA256 fingerprint: B6:76:FF:A3:17:9E:88:12:09:3A:1B:5E:AF:EE:87:6A:E7:A6:AA:F2:31:07:8D:AD:1B:FB:21:CD:28:93:76:4A
#    NotAfter: Nov 21 2028
